WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,880
Now suddenly five children have high fever again

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,880
The most important thing is that I'm afraid it might be the plague.

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:06,680
Do you have to go to the frozen world tomorrow?

4
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:10,720
Can you think of a way to get some fresh medicine over there?

5
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:17,390
I'll try to get some medicine and come back tomorrow, yes, yes, you must be fine soon, little general.

6
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:19,070
You'd better go to bed quickly

7
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:20,590
Didn't rest all night

8
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:22,910
I heard that you wiped out everyone in Qinglong Village

9
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:30,630
Why don't you bother, General?

10
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:33,190
Let me tell you what we learned last night

11
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:34,470
No need to report to me

12
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:35,630
Just tell Mr. Fan

13
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:37,270
Have the fevers of those five children gone?

14
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:38,750
Mr. Fan just went to bed

15
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:41,030
Said that the five children still had high fever

16
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:43,990
If this goes on, I'm afraid something will happen, so don't worry about it.

17
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:45,430
I'm going to be frozen now

18
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,670
Let's see if we can get some medicine back.

19
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:48,190
Then don't worry here

20
00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:51,270
Mr. Fan and I will be optimistic about it, so go ahead and do your work first.

21
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:52,950
I changed my clothes and got ready to go
